 13	 *   AC4 — The credential-missing error detection uses the sentinel text
 14	 *          ("requires a credential for host") from the orchestrator error
 15	 *          messages (WP-007).
 16	 *
 17	 * Additional toast message tests:
 18	 *   T1  — When all failures are credential-related, the toast mentions
 19	 *          "credential errors" and the affected repository IDs.
 20	 *   T2  — When failures are a mix of credential and non-credential, the
 21	 *          toast distinguishes them with two segments:
 22	 *          "Missing credentials for: <cred-repos>. Failed to clone: <other-repos>."
 23	 *   T3  — When all failures are non-credential, the original toast message
 24	 *          is shown unchanged.
 25	 *
 26	 * Uses Node's built-in test runner with jsdom for a minimal DOM environment.
 27	 * Run individually with:
 28	 *   node --test gui/public/js/views/workspace-detail.credential-error.test.mjs
